---
title: Player Info is now available
---

You can now look up a public player profile by UID, including the nickname, Trailblaze and Equilibrium levels, signature, character/Light Cone/achievement counts, and showcase characters.

Opening a character from Player Info shows their actual level, promotion, stats, skills, traces, and Eidolons, together with the equipped Light Cone, Relics, and their affixes.

**Public player information is Powered by MiHoMo API (Mar-7th). We express our sincere gratitude to the developers and maintainers of the service for making their technology accessible.** 

This update also improves overall performance of the site. 

